{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f2bb11c1-5df8-83e0-8e63-baefa0c816cc",
  "created_at": "2026-01-28T18:57:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Neusa Varela",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:51:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine. City Hall's closed for the day, but I'm here on this line. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:51:16-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Hello. Um, my name is Neusa Varela. I am calling about the snow. The street. [pause] It is still not plowed, the little part where I live."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:51:29-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Ms. Varela, I'm sorry to hear that. Is this from the storm over the weekend, the snow that turned to rain Sunday into Monday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:51:41-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, that one. Sunday the snow, then Monday the rain, and then it freezes. Now it is like a wall at the end of the street. The plow comes and goes by and leaves it. Again. This is not the first time it is like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:52:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's frustrating, especially two days on. Can I get your name spelled for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:52:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Neusa. N, E, U, S, A. Varela, V, A, R, E, L, A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:52:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Neusa Varela, got it. And what's the street, hon? I'll need to know where the wall of snow is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:52:25-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. [pause] I am sorry, I do not like to say my address on the telephone. I can say it is a short street, a dead end, off the main road. The plow does the main road and not us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:52:43-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can you tell me the name of the street or the nearest main road, so I can note it for the crew?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:52:54-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The, um. [pause] What was I saying. Yes. The main road. It is the one with the church on the corner. The dead end is right after. Mrs. Pacheco's house is at the end."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:53:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, a dead end right past the church on the corner. And who's Mrs. Pacheco?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:53:17-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My neighbor. She is in the eighties, she is alone. She cannot get out. She has the walker, and the ice, and the snow is up to here at the bottom of her steps. She needs a path. Even only a path, one person wide."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:53:37-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So an elderly neighbor, uses a walker, can't get out at all right now. I'm marking that as a priority. Does she need anything urgent, like medication or a doctor's visit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:53:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "She has a visit. At the doctor. [pause] Friday, I think. Friday the thirtieth. No, wait, she told me the third. Friday the third."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:54:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, let me think. This Friday is the thirtieth, and the third would be the following Tuesday. Which one did she say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:54:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The third. I wrote it down, Friday the third. She said it twice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:54:20-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll write what you've got, but let me say it back so we're sure. Appointment on the third, and you said Friday. Those don't match on the calendar, so it may be Friday the thirtieth, or a different day. Could you check with her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:54:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, it is the third. I am sure. I have it in the paper. Friday the third. You write that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:54:50-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've written it down the way you said it, Friday the third. I'll add a note that the date might need confirming, so nobody gets caught out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:55:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. [pause] And also, the sand. Can somebody bring sand? It is ice under the snow. I put the salt from the kitchen, it does nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:55:16-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I can put in a request for sand at the dead end. I'll mark it for the end of the street by Mrs. Pacheco's steps. Is that the spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:55:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, at her steps. And in the street too, where the cars slide. Nobody can go, not even the mailman came."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:55:40-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so a path cleared to her door, sand on her steps area and the street. And the plow pass on the dead end itself. Did I get all of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:55:54-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That is all. [pause] I am sorry, I lost, what was the other thing. Yes. When they come? Because I called Monday night also, and nobody came."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:56:07-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You called Monday night too? I'm sorry, nobody got back to you. I don't see the details in front of me, but I'll note it as a second call. As for timing, crews are working through the side streets in order, so I'd say sometime tomorrow, possibly into Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:56:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow, possibly Friday. But she has the doctor Friday. [pause] So it must be tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:56:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll flag it as needing to be done before Friday, then. Can I take a number in case someone needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:56:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is four zero one, five five five, zero one seven six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:56:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-six. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:56:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. It is the house phone. I am always here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:57:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So I have Neusa Varela, dead end past the church, neighbor with a walker needing a path, sand, second call about it. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:57:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Only please, somebody come. It is Wednesday already. Two days. [pause] Thank you for writing it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:57:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Varela. Keep your own steps dry and careful tonight. Goodnight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:57:32-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodnight."
    }
  ],
